      "label": "_quiz_prompt (Ollama AI path)",
      "file_type": "code",
      "source_file": "C:\\Users\\marsh\\Documents\\LecturePack-worktrees\\release-polish\\docs\\evidence\\v1.2.0\\webview_functionality_recovery\\quiz_quality\\README.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Rewritten in lecturepack/services/study_assistant_service.py: demands questions grounded in a specific transcript fact/name/number, exactly one correct option, plausible on-topic distractors, no meta questions about 'the lecture', no 'all/none of the above'. Difficulty and question type are now threaded through the worker into the prompt (previously ignored)."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_evidence_v1_2_0_webview_functionality_recovery_quiz_quality_README_grounded_cloze",
      "label": "Grounded cloze (fill-in-the-blank) fallback generator",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "C:\\Users\\marsh\\Documents\\LecturePack-worktrees\\release-polish\\docs\\evidence\\v1.2.0\\webview_functionality_recovery\\quiz_quality\\README.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Deterministic no-AI fallback: a sentence mentioning a key term is blanked and distractors are other key terms that do NOT appear in that sentence, so the answer is unambiguous. Replaces the weak 'Which of the following is a key term?' quiz that used unrelated generic distractors."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_evidence_v1_2_0_webview_functionality_recovery_quiz_quality_README_clean_terms",
      "label": "_clean_terms key-term cleaner",
